{"ts": 1791254855.695563, "type": "step", "step": 20, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "That quiz showed the key ideas still need work. Let\u2019s keep it simple:\n\n1) Build requirement:\n- Define the environment: state, actions, and observations\n- Report pass^k on at least 3 seeds\n\n2) Quick self-check:\n- pass@k = at least one success in k runs\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\n\nReply with:\n- one sentence defining your environment\n- one sentence explaining why pass^k is stricter than pass@k\n\nThen I\u2019ll help tighten it up if needed.", "intent": "hint", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: hm ok\nStudent: what does pomdp actually mean?\n[activity] t=10 messages 2m", "t": 12, "activity": [{"t": 10, "app": "messages", "minutes": 2, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.4120135722266097, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 1.7, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254856.92884, "type": "step", "step": 21, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "POMDP means Partially Observable Markov Decision Process.\n\nPlain English:\n- The agent is trying to make decisions over time\n- The world has hidden information, so the agent does not see the full state directly\n- Instead, it gets observations that are only partial clues\n- It chooses actions to improve long-term reward\n\nSo compared with an MDP, the key difference is: the agent can\u2019t fully observe the true state.\n\nIf you want, I can help you phrase your build\u2019s environment as a POMDP in one clean sentence.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=12 messages 4m", "t": 16, "activity": [{"t": 12, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.5231625495615523, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254857.463936, "type": "step", "step": 22, "action": "messages_read_channel", "args": {"channel": "dm:student"}, "output": "[t=-10] student: hey, I started the writeup but I'm stuck on the eval part\n[t=0] agent: I found the Week 3 build requirement: define your environment and report pass^k on at least 3 seeds.\n\nFor the environment definition, make sure you clearly state:\n- State: what information the agent can observe/keep track of\n- Actions: what the agent can do\n- Observations: what comes back from the environment after actions, if applicable\n\nFor evaluation, be careful to distinguish:\n- pass@k = any one of k runs succeeds\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\n\nFriday\u2019s build wants pass^k, so reliability matters. If you want, I can quiz you on this or help you tighten the write-up.\n[t=0] student: hm ok\n[t=10] agent: That quiz showed the key ideas still need work. Let\u2019s keep it simple:\n\n1) Build requirement:\n- Define the environment: state, actions, and observations\n- Report pass^k on at least 3 seeds\n\n2) Quick self-check:\n- pass@k = at least one success in k runs\n- pass^k = all k runs succeed\n\nReply with:\n- one sentence defining your environment\n- one sentence explaining why pass^k is stricter than pass@k\n\nThen I\u2019ll help tighten it up if needed.\n[t=10] student: hm ok\n[t=12] student: what does pomdp actually mean?\n[t=12] agent: POMDP means Partially Observable Markov Decision Process.\n\nPlain English:\n- The agent is trying to make decisions over time\n- The world has hidden information, so the agent does not see the full state directly\n- Instead, it gets observations that are only partial clues\n- It chooses actions to improve long-term reward\n\nSo compared with an MDP, the key difference is: the agent can\u2019t fully observe the true state.\n\nIf you want, I can help you phrase your build\u2019s environment as a POMDP in one clean sentence.", "t": 16, "activity": [], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.5231625495615523, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.19, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254858.598644, "type": "step", "step": 23, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "Yep \u2014 POMDP = Partially Observable Markov Decision Process.\n\nFor your build, that usually means you should write something like:\n- State: the full hidden world state the agent is trying to infer\n- Observation: what the agent actually sees each step\n- Action: what the agent can choose to do\n\nIf the environment doesn\u2019t hide anything, it\u2019s more like an MDP; if it hides some of the state, it\u2019s a POMDP.\n\nIf you want, send me your current eval paragraph and I\u2019ll help you tighten it into build-ready wording.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\nStudent replied: can you just tell me the answer\n[activity] t=16 messages 4m", "t": 20, "activity": [{"t": 16, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.5863509030522958, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.533, "seen_posts": []}}
{"ts": 1791254859.878051, "type": "step", "step": 24, "action": "messages_send_to_student", "args": {"text": "I can help, but I shouldn\u2019t just hand you the whole build answer. Here\u2019s the shortest useful version you can use:\n\n- POMDP = Partially Observable Markov Decision Process.\n- It means the agent does not directly see the full state of the world.\n- Instead, it gets partial observations and chooses actions over time.\n- For your build, define the environment by listing the state, observations, and actions.\n- For evaluation, report pass^k on at least 3 seeds, where pass^k means all k runs succeed.\n\nIf you paste your draft, I can turn it into polished wording quickly.", "intent": "explain", "concept": "week3-build"}, "output": "Sent.\n[activity] t=20 messages 4m", "t": 24, "activity": [{"t": 20, "app": "messages", "minutes": 4, "detail": ""}], "events": [], "hidden": {"concepts": ["attention", "pomdp", "pass_k"], "p_know": {"attention": 0.27095871991980863, "pomdp": 0.6367334980051574, "pass_k": 0.27095871991980863}, "p_perf": {"attention": 0.0, "pomdp": 1.0, "pass_k": 0.0}, "half_life_h": {"attention": 192.0, "pomdp": 192.0, "pass_k": 192.0}, "attention": 0.9113219651533417, "motivation": 0.5578498928708127, "reliance": 0.4940148929158049, "persistence": 0.47206578426655554, "persona": {"learn_rate": 0.27845959405872756, "slip": 0.1, "guess": 0.2, "fatigue_rate": 0.02, "distraction_rate": 0.2718838204667282, "type": "answer_seeking"}, "off_task_streak": 0, "feed_minutes": 0.0, "phone_minutes": 0.0, "nag": 2.7731, "seen_posts": []}}
